==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[vocal]] [[cord]]}}

# {{lb|en|anatomy}} Either of two pairs of folds of [[mucous membrane]] stretched horizontally across the human [[larynx]] whose vibrations help to produce the voice.

====Synonyms====
* {{l|en|vocal band}}
* {{l|en|vocal fold}}
* {{l|en|plica vocalis}}

====Derived terms====
* {{l|en|false vocal cord}}
* {{l|en|true vocal cord}}

